# VS Code-only extensions — NOT installable in Cursor.
# Install with: `make ext`
# Shared extensions live in Extfile; Cursor equivalents in Extfile.cursor.
#
# Everything here is Microsoft-proprietary and published only to the Microsoft
# Marketplace, which Microsoft's terms restrict to official VS Code builds.
# Cursor ships Anysphere forks of the remote stack — see Extfile.cursor.

# --- Remote development (Microsoft stack) ---
# SSH remote development host (Cursor: anysphere.remote-ssh)
ms-vscode-remote.remote-ssh
# SSH config file editing, companion to remote-ssh
ms-vscode-remote.remote-ssh-edit
# Remote target explorer sidebar
ms-vscode.remote-explorer

# --- Copilot / Chat ---
# Chat customization evaluation tooling (VS Code chat only)
ms-vscode.vscode-chat-customizations-evaluations

# --- Collaboration ---
# Real-time collaborative editing (absent from OpenVSX, so VS Code only)
ms-vsliveshare.vsliveshare
